.TH "TODOPRO GITHUB PROJECTS" "1" "2026-10-13" "1.0.0" "todopro github projects Manual"
.SH NAME
todopro\-github\-projects \- List your GitHub Projects v2 visible to...
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B todopro github projects
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List your GitHub Projects v2 visible to the connected PAT (Pro).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o,\fP \-\-output TEXT
Output format (pretty, json, yaml)  [default: pretty]
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fP
Output as JSON (alias for --output json)
